=2 Walkthrough
>**{c=red:Warning:}** **{p:Trust Magic} can not be used in this BCNM.**
* Speak to {n:Kerutoto}, {z:Windurst Waters South|Windurst Waters} (J-8) HP #3, for a cutscene that begins the quest and key item {@k} {k:Vial of dream incense}.
** {z:Windurst Waters} Home Point #3 is just south of {n:Kerutoto}.
* Head to {z:Pso'Xja} Home Point #1.

----
{@g:Red}**If you do not yet have the Home Point**:
* Travel to {z:Beaucedine Glacier} (H-8) and enter {z:Pso'Xja}.
** The {z:Beaucedine Glacier} Survival Guide brings you at H-9, just south of the entrance to {z:Pso'Xja}.
* Once inside, the correct displacement sequence is {c=white:red} > {c=white:purple} > {c=white:red} > {c=white:purple}.
** You will lose all buffs each time you go through the displacements; this includes {p:Trust Magic|Category:Trust}.
* Take the elevator down.
* Head forward (North), then left (West) at the intersection.
* Use the Stone Gate and select **Yes** when asked to use the {k:Pso'Xja pass}{@k}.
* The Home Point is just past the gate on the left.

----
* Head down the steps into {z:The Shrouded Maw}.
* Select the Memento Circle and pick **Waking Dreams.**
* Defeat {m:Diabolos Prime} to receive a key item: {@k} {k:Whisper of dreams}.
** Diabolos Prime has the following spells and abilities:
*** Drain
*** Aspir
*** Sleepga II
*** Dispelga
*** Blindga
*** {p:Noctoshield}- grants Diabolos the effect of "{p:Phalanx|Phalanx (Status)}."
*** {p:Dream Shroud}- Enhances {p:magic attack|Magic Attack Bonus} and {p:magic defense|Magic Defense Bonus} of Diabolos.
*** {p:Camisado}- Deals physical damage.
*** {p:Nether Blast}- Delivers a ranged attack that deals darkness elemental damage.
*** {p:Ultimate Terror}- Decreases attributes of players within area of effect.
*** {p:Nightmare}- Deals darkness elemental damage that puts all enemies within the area of effect to sleep and gradually reduces their HP.
*** {p:Ruinous Omen}- {p:Astral Flow} ability- Reduces the HP of enemies within the area of effect by a random percentage.
** Tiles on the battlefield will vanish during the battle, dropping players to a {p:Diremites|Category:Diremite}-filled death.
* Return to Kerutoto with the whisper and she will provide several reward options including the ability to summon Diabolos.

=2 Notes
* Up to 6 party members can enter the arena.
* Each party member must have their own {@k} {k:Vial of dream incense}
* Time limit is 30 minutes
* You can only select 1 of the rewards Kerutoto offers at any time
* You may repeat this quest once per Earth day.
* When clearing for the first time, the event with Diabolos in {z:The Shrouded Maw} will change depending on your progress in {M:Chains of Promathia Missions|Chains of Promathia Missions|Chains of Promathia Missions}.

